(7520345, 1201383, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes to the challenge.<br/> <br/>A pleasing landscape and interesting interpretation of this effectively open challenge. Your composition is good with the walkway forming the focal point and the still waters have duplicated it nicely with its reflections. The blue light dominates and the silhouettes of the trees make a pleasing frame, the foreground tree however is a little detrimental to the effect. Overall a nice result but a chainsaw could have been useful here Drake!</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes to the challenge. A pleasing landscape and interesting interpretation of this effectively open challenge. Your composition is good with the walkway forming the focal point and the still waters have duplicated it nicely with its reflections. The blue light dominates and the silhouettes of the trees make a pleasing frame, the foreground tree however is a little detrimental to the effect. Overall a nice result but a chainsaw could have been useful here Drake!', '2017-06-26 10:49:34.000000', NULL, 0),
