(7520359, 1201448, 86447, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, Ken!<br/> <br/>It''s interesting... I gave you a 9 during voting.  If I''d given you a 1 vote instead, I''d have beaten you... and you''d be in 9th place instead of an HM.<br/> <br/>It''s interesting to me how one vote can effect the outcome of a challenge this severely.  <br/> <br/>I don''t recall ever giving a 1 vote in my entire stay here in DPCville.   But, I was just wondering, so I did the math.  :D<br/> <br/>I wish the text on the bottle matched the text on the box, but I''m nit picking.  :D<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congratulations, Ken! It''s interesting... I gave you a 9 during voting.  If I''d given you a 1 vote instead, I''d have beaten you... and you''d be in 9th place instead of an HM. It''s interesting to me how one vote can effect the outcome of a challenge this severely.   I don''t recall ever giving a 1 vote in my entire stay here in DPCville.   But, I was just wondering, so I did the math.  :D I wish the text on the bottle matched the text on the box, but I''m nit picking.  :D ', '2017-06-26 11:48:21.000000', NULL, 0),
