(7520427, 1201448, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i>I wish the text on the bottle matched the text on the box, but I''m nit picking.  :D </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Casting those fine serifs into the glass is impractical, and I don''t think the font used (Lithos?) has the missing acute accents over the "e"s (another inconsistency) ... now if the lettering on the bottle was etched or engraved ... :-)<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Benjamin Franklin:</b></div><hr/><i>So convenient a thing it is to be a reasonable creature, since it enables one to find or make a reason for everything one has a mind to do.</i></td></tr></table> <br/><b>@Art:</b> congrats on the HM!</td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia:I wish the text on the bottle matched the text on the box, but I''m nit picking.  :D  Casting those fine serifs into the glass is impractical, and I don''t think the font used (Lithos?) has the missing acute accents over the "e"s (another inconsistency) ... now if the lettering on the bottle was etched or engraved ... :-)Originally posted by Benjamin Franklin:So convenient a thing it is to be a reasonable creature, since it enables one to find or make a reason for everything one has a mind to do. @Art: congrats on the HM!', '2017-06-26 19:05:34.000000', NULL, 0),
